      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        <span>⚡</span> Quick Answer (Easiest European Digital Nomad Visas)
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-200 text-base leading-relaxed font-medium">
        The easiest digital nomad visas in Europe for 2026 combine low monthly income thresholds and swift approvals: Romania (€3,700/mo, fast online portal), Croatia (€2,539/mo, 100% local income tax exempt), Portugal D8 (€3,280/mo), and Hungary White Card (€3,000/mo). Qualification mandates foreign employer contracts, active health insurance, clean criminal records, and verifiable remote work status.
      </p>
    </div>

