    <div class="my-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The 2026 European Nomad Leaderboard</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mb-6">
        Ranked across financial accessibility, statutory processing efficiency, tax friction, and long-term residency rights.
      </p>

